spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given circuit
* Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC <VDD_value>
* MOSFET
M1 4 3 2 2 NMOS
* Capacitors
C_GD 4 3 <CGD_value>
? Missing component
C_DB 4 0 <CDB_value>
C_L_CS 2 0 <CL_plus_CSB_value>
* Resistor
R_L 2 0 <RL_value>
* .MODEL Definitions (assuming generic NMOS model)
.model NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1)
